      "block_id": "2605.23244_p29_b15",
      "text": "COALA is trained using a single RTX-4090 GPU (24GB) with JAX, while SFT, DPO, and ORPO use individual A100 GPUs\n(40GB) with PyTorch. To ensure fair comparison, each (Method \u00d7 Dataset \u00d7 Model) setup is run at least three times. Unlike\nother methods, COALA requires no PEFT tuning, and instead leverages CRONOS (Section 4) for efficient optimization\nover high-dimensional features for its stage one training. Table 12 explicitly details hardware setup across experiments, and\nthe following subsection H.2 details PEFT configurations used for the strongest competitors.\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.11,
        510.3,
        541.44,
        568.01
